<DocsLayout title="Configuration files">
  <h2>User config</h2>
  <p><code>config.toml</code> in MarkRust’s platform configuration directory — editor preferences (theme, UI and code fonts, autosave interval).</p>

  <h2>Recent workspaces</h2>
  <p><code>recent.json</code> beside the user config — list of recently opened folder paths.</p>

  <h2>Document files</h2>
  <p>Your <code>.md</code> files are plain UTF-8. No MarkRust-specific encoding or metadata is embedded in documents.</p>
</DocsLayout>
